AccountV3Enrollment.verifyChange
├── current policy authorizes exact SecurityChange
│   ├── existing ADMIN quorum, not prospective keys or SPEND-only signers
│   ├── new or role-changed descriptor proves possession
│   ├── unchanged/removed keys do not need new proof
│   └── missing, duplicate, extra, stale, wrong-scope proofs fail
├── consumer profile
│   ├── one active WebAuthn key can spend and administer
│   └── optional equivalent backup keeps SPEND/ADMIN at 1-of-N
└── pure consent verification
    └── account owns proposal, nonce, fresh commit and storage transitions
